+; `ret`). Called at fat_mount's success tail (basic/fat-prim-body.inc), after
+; fat_geom_read put logical sector 1 in FAT_DBUF. LOAD ONCE, KEEP IT (what the
+; CF-3300 evidently does): a resident FAT whose first sector equals that one is
+; kept and the mount costs no DSKIO (fres_same); else the whole FAT is read again
+; (fres_offz -> fres_read). Re-reading per mount doubled small operations' time:
+; sector 1 again, from the start, waits ~a revolution (scratchpad/fatres_ops.bas).
